{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kyiv \u2013 Vorozhba railway route, with a length of 297 km, passes through the territories of Kyiv, Chernihiv, and Sumy regions, connecting the capital of Ukraine with an important railway hub in the northeast of the country.<br>The entire route section is electrified with 25 kV AC and is mostly a double-track line.<br>The route runs through flat terrain with minor elevation changes. It is mainly used for long-distance and suburban passenger trains, as well as for freight transportation. The route serves long-distance passenger trains (e.g., Kyiv \u2013 Sumy, Kyiv \u2013 Kharkiv, international destinations) and suburban electric trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This route is an important railway artery that connects Kyiv with the northeastern regions of Ukraine.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614920?t=1744918014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614920/5009ab852afc42d34291dc6c42692522a5f3587e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744918014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614920/ad787f295c0e7106ef4c224585dbeeff5cc3405e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744918014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614920/ad787f295c0e7106ef4c224585dbeeff5cc3405e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744918014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kyiv \u2013 Vorozhba railway route, with a length of 297 km, passes through the territories of Kyiv, Chernihiv, and Sumy regions, connecting the capital of Ukraine with an important railway hub in the northeast of the country.<br>The entire route section is electrified with 25 kV AC and is mostly a double-track line.<br>The route runs through flat terrain with minor elevation changes. It is mainly used for long-distance and suburban passenger trains, as well as for freight transportation. The route serves long-distance passenger trains (e.g., Kyiv \u2013 Sumy, Kyiv \u2013 Kharkiv, international destinations) and suburban electric trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This route is an important railway artery that connects Kyiv with the northeastern regions of Ukraine.</p>","developers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3381120","name":"ZDSimulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614920/1194459a2f0a1001e65f854a011751a81ed69fc6/header.jpg?t=1744918014","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ZDSimulator - Kyiv-Vorozhba Route","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"ZDSimulator - Kyiv-Vorozhba Route - $12.99 USD","packageid":1274637,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1299}],"title":"Buy ZDSimulator - Kyiv-Vorozhba Route"}],"packages":[1274637],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1299,"final_formatted":"$12.99 USD","initial":1299,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"17 Apr, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full"